meta {
  name: Set Write Policy
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

put {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/write-requests/policy
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "writeModeEnabled": true,
    "directEnvs": [
      "DEV"
    ]
  }
}

docs {
  Update write-mode and direct-write environments. No production-like environment —
  any name containing "prod" (PROD, SUPER_PROD, PREPROD) — can be direct-write; the
  request 422s naming the ones that were sent. They are also stripped on read, so a
  hand-edited setting can't grant direct-write on production either.

  `directEnvs` values must be environments this deployment has (see
  `GET /api/config` → `environments`); an unknown one is a 400.

  Requires a valid Bearer JWT ({{token}}).
  **Admin only.**
}
